First-time setup complete.
  config: <STATE_ROOT>/grm_config.json
  index:  <STATE_ROOT>/grm_index.json
Usage:
  providers list
  providers show <name>
  providers add <name> <url> [--type auto|github|gitea|gitlab|rngit] [--api URL] [--token-env VAR]
  providers update <name> [--type ...] [--api URL] [--url URL] [--token-env VAR] [--force]
  providers remove <name> [--abandon | --purge]
  providers recover <name> [--type ...] [--api URL]
